      "note": [
        "Amount issued during the month, gross, msek for Sveriges riksbank is not reported in these statistics. Sveriges riksbank issues weekly certificates, which are both issued and mature the same month. As amount issued during the month, gross, is only calculated on securities outstanding at the end of the month, the report is otherwise misleading for this sector.",
        "From reference month October 2024, the statistics have been replaced with new tables. New breakdown at currency level and two new yield debtor variables are presented. \r\n  Substantial revisions concerning the statistics for the MFI non covered sector were made for reference period from May 2019 to July 2025, with an update during the production month of August 2025."
